OL,3,GNEWSAFringe ends with 2.8 million
OL,4,Atickets issued - an 8% increase on last
OL,5,Ayear
OL,6,
OL,7,FEdinburgh Festival Fringe issued 2.8
OL,8,Fmillion tickets for shows during this
OL,9,Fyear's event - an 8% increase on last
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FThe Fringe Society ` which oversees the
OL,13,Funcurated festival ` said it also
OL,14,Fnotched up the highest attendance for a
OL,15,Fsingle day on the second Saturday in
OL,16,FAugust.
OL,18,FMore than 164,000 tickets were issued
OL,19,Fon that day, which was 1% higher than
OL,20,Fthe previous peak on Saturday 17 August
OL,21,F2019.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
